Don't know nearly enough about your character, but here are some things
I would consider (spoilers)


- How are your stats? Need some Int or Dex? Maybe you need potions of
  gain ability or some food to boost specific stat?
- If you are intelligent enough - how about spellbooks (there are quite
  a few useful ones: charm monster, fireball, identify, magic mapping...)
- You may miss magic resistance (does Magicbane give it? If so you'll need
  to wield it all the time with more powerful weapons in your pack...)
- You definitely will need levitation - jumping is not enough in certain
  places. Ring of boots.
- Consider genociding some more nasty things. A wish for a magic marker
  is usually better than a wish for scrolls (unsless you have not found
  genocide scroll yet).
- a wand of death helps a lot in dealing with some nasties (specifically
  those that teleport away when low on HP - they'll never get low on HP ;-)
- Finally: Save 1-2 wishes for later. You never know - sometimes you 
  absolutely need something really trivial... I normally end up ascending
  with a not-fully-used-up WoW.

